ps://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/07/10/7988875/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/07/10/7988875/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかね、わたし、\n儚げなんだって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか良くわからないけど、儚さがあるらしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言われたときは、ハテナ(*_*）？？\nだったんだけど...（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、儚くも、強くありたいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さな百合の花のようにって\n名付けられた意味がね、\nあるからね、きっと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小百合ように小百合らしく＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9枚目も、よろしくお願いします(* ^o^ *)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/07/10/7988875/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(。・ω・。)正義！"}],"source":"archive"}